    "detailed_description": "<h1>Buzz</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1284300/extras/cb2edd0a7aef720604efb1b54c1f340c.avif?t=1643797787\" /></div><br>\u201cKing of Spies\u201d is a political spy-thriller visual novel and yuri dating sim.  You play as Kelly Bond, a former USAF Intelligence Officer turned political espionage specialist. Infiltrate a rising political star\u2019s campaign and discover their deepest secrets as your mission will decide the country\u2019s fate forever!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1284300/extras/7342d2b6da2fe9f81d5815faf9c161f1.webp?t=1643797787\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A gripping political espionage and romance storyline.<br></li><li>Soothing contemporary jazz soundtrack<br></li><li>Beautiful anime art<br></li><li>Multiple endings</li></ul>",
